/*
 * Static atoms: names known at build time (tag names, attribute names, keywords).
 * HK_NAME(identifier, "string") defines HK_ATOM_<identifier> == its 1-based position.
 * Append new names anywhere; ids are not persisted, so reordering is safe.
 */

/* --- HTML elements --- */
HK_NAME(a, "a")
